 "findings": [
  {
   "evidence": "Beta.lean:131-136 (`rw [... ProbabilityTheory.beta]`, `push_cast`, `simp only [\u2190 Complex.Gamma_ofReal]`, `push_cast`, `field_simp`); Mathlib `theorem _root_.Complex.Gamma_ofReal (s : \u211d) : Complex.Gamma (s : \u2102) = Gamma s` at Gamma/Basic.lean:419 is untagged, and `ProbabilityTheory.beta` is `Real.Gamma \u03b1 * Real.Gamma \u03b2 / Real.Gamma (\u03b1 + \u03b2)` (Probability/Distributions/Beta.lean:33-34).",
   "file": "EpsilonEridani/QFT/Factorization/Convolution/Beta.lean",
   "fix": "Extract the bridge as its own lemma next to `betaPDFReal_of_mem_Ioo`, e.g. `lemma ofReal_beta (a b : \u211d) : ((ProbabilityTheory.beta a b : \u211d) : \u2102) = Complex.Gamma a * Complex.Gamma b / Complex.Gamma (a + b)`, and let `mellinDis_betaPDFReal` be `rw [mellinDis_congr \u2026, mellinDis_const_mul, mellinDis_rpow_mul_one_sub_rpow hb hN, ofReal_beta]; field_simp`.",
   "issue": "`mellinDis_betaPDFReal` closes with `rw [..., ProbabilityTheory.beta]; push_cast; simp only [\u2190 Complex.Gamma_ofReal]; push_cast; field_simp` \u2014 a normalise/de-normalise/re-normalise cast sequence that hides the fact actually being used, `((ProbabilityTheory.beta a b : \u211d) : \u2102) = \u0393 a * \u0393 b / \u0393 (a + b)`, and unfolds `ProbabilityTheory.beta` by its equation lemma even though the PR otherwise routes definition unfolding through a characterisation lemma (`betaPDFReal_of_mem_Ioo`). The backwards `simp only [\u2190 Complex.Gamma_ofReal]` followed by `push_cast` works only because `Complex.Gamma_ofReal` is not in the cast simp set (Mathlib/Analysis/SpecialFunctions/Gamma/Basic.lean:419 carries no `norm_cast`/`simp` attribute); tagging it upstream silently reverses the step.",
   "line": 133
  }
 ],
